{"strongs": "H5977", "word": "עֹ֫מֶד", "translit": "o.med", "root": "עמד", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "standing-place", "definition": "[ עֹ֫מֶד ] noun [masculine] standing-place ; — only suffix after preposition וַיָּקוּמוּ עַלעָֿמְדָם׃ Neh 9:3 they stood up in their place (later equivalent of תַּחְתָּם ), Neh 8:7 (no verb); with עָמַד 2Chr 30:16 ; 2Chr 35:10 , עַלעָֿמְדוֺ ׳ ע 2Chr 34:31 וָאַעֲמִדֵם עַלעָֿמְדָם Neh 13:11 , so עַלעָֿמְדִי Dan 8:18 וַיָּבֹא אֵצֶל עָמְדִי v Dan 8:17 עֲמֹד עַלעָֿמְדֶ֑ךָ Dan 10:11 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6129')\">BDB6129</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5977')\">H5977</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6128')\">BDB6128</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6130')\">BDB6130</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>עֹ֫מֶד</bdbheb>] <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>standing-place</highlightword>; — only suffix after preposition <bdbheb>וַיָּקוּמוּ עַלעָֿמְדָם׃</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 9:3\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,3)\">Neh 9:3</ref> <highlight>they stood up in their place</highlight> (later equivalent of <bdbheb>תַּחְתָּם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Neh 8:7\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,7)\">Neh 8:7</ref> (no verb); with <bdbheb>עָמַד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 30:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,16)\">2Chr 30:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:10\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,10)\">2Chr 35:10</ref>, <bdbheb>עַלעָֿמְדוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:31\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,31)\">2Chr 34:31</ref> <bdbheb>וָאַעֲמִדֵם עַלעָֿמְדָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 13:11\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,11)\">Neh 13:11</ref>, so <bdbheb>עַלעָֿמְדִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 8:18\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,18)\">Dan 8:18</ref> <bdbheb>וַיָּבֹא אֵצֶל עָמְדִי</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Dan 8:17\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,17)\">Dan 8:17</ref> <bdbheb>עֲמֹד עַלעָֿמְדֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 10:11\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,11)\">Dan 10:11</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Neh 9:3", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Neh 8:7", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "2Chr 30:16", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 30, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "2Chr 35:10", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 35, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "2Chr 34:31", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 34, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Neh 13:11", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 13, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Dan 8:18", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 8, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Dan 8:17", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 8, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Dan 10:11", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 10, "verse": 11}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["עֹ֫מֶד", "וַיָּקוּמוּ עַלעָֿמְדָם׃", "תַּחְתָּם", "עָמַד", "עַלעָֿמְדוֺ", "׳", "ע", "וָאַעֲמִדֵם עַלעָֿמְדָם", "עַלעָֿמְדִי", "וַיָּבֹא אֵצֶל עָמְדִי", "עֲמֹד עַלעָֿמְדֶ֑ךָ"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB6129", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}